(text "Placa LiveSafe v1.0 - esquema elétrico" (at 20 12 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 1da7512f-e8a2-542b-b984-557c814f29f8))
(text "Monitoração de sinal de TV e rádio nos abrigos: RF ISDB-Tb, HDMI e ASI num Raspberry Pi CM4 rodando o LiveSafe Monitor." (at 20 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid a7f2bd75-8d31-51a2-a2d8-97bcec3525f5))
(text "Projeto e PCB: Marcos Silva dos Santos (MarcosObel) - github.com/aragonxpd154/LiveSafe-Placa" (at 20 26 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid a2158bb8-3ff0-5675-b4cb-28a3c0860b00))
(sheet (at 20 40) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid 9f44fd1d-0111-5ac1-af3d-4ced99cd13b1) (property "Sheetname" "Alimentação 12 V" (at 20 39.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "01-alimentacao.kicad_sch" (at 20 66.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "2")))))
(text "Entrada de 12 V (9 a 18 V) com fusível rearmável, TVS e\nproteção contra inversão; dois buck LMR33630 geram 5 V e 3,3 V\n(3 A cada) e um TLV62569 gera 1,2 V para os núcleos do\ndemodulador e do receptor ASI." (at 22 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 898f58d5-d75e-5d5f-9a60-f9d948f2aad9))
(sheet (at 118 40) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid 532fd83c-a6c4-57e3-af9f-61dd040859bd) (property "Sheetname" "Raspberry Pi CM4" (at 118 39.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "02-cm4.kicad_sch" (at 118 66.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "3")))))
(text "O módulo CM4 (BCM2711, 4 GB, eMMC) roda o Linux e o LiveSafe\nMonitor. Os GPIO trabalham em 3,3 V (GPIO_VREF ligado à saída\nde 3,3 V do próprio CM4)." (at 120 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6cc799bb-db22-534a-b9ce-bf6f6094ccc6))
(sheet (at 216 40) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid e98b7525-6dea-5847-a208-c9a1611e6687) (property "Sheetname" "Ethernet Gigabit" (at 216 39.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "03-ethernet.kicad_sch" (at 216 66.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "4")))))
(text "O PHY BCM54210PE está dentro do CM4; aqui ficam só o RJ45 com\nmagnéticos e os LEDs. Pares diferenciais de 100 Ohm, iguais em\ncomprimento, sem vias." (at 218 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1763d5a3-936e-5296-a48b-09c0fcbaf3ad))
(sheet (at 314 40) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid 1a1c955a-be06-59b4-8819-bb45600b0371) (property "Sheetname" "Entrada HDMI (TC358743XBG)" (at 314 39.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "04-hdmi.kicad_sch" (at 314 66.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "5")))))
(text "Ponte HDMI 1.4 para MIPI CSI-2 de 4 vias (CAM1 do CM4) com\náudio I2S. Circuito de referência da Antmicro\n(hdmi-mipi-bridge, Apache-2.0) adaptado: proteção ESD\nTPD4E05U06 e HPD comandado pelo HPDO." (at 316 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a34484d9-da6e-552a-8ff4-038c5bd5e3de))
(sheet (at 20 88) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid 7f3d6b5e-6bcf-59bd-8eb6-ecc451b95583) (property "Sheetname" "Recepção ISDB-Tb (Si2141 + Si2183)" (at 20 87.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "05-rf.kicad_sch" (at 20 114.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "6")))))
(text "Antena (75 Ohm) -> sintonizador Si2141 (IF baixa) ->\ndemodulador Si2183-B60 -> TS paralelo para a FX2LP #1.\nControle pelo I2C1 do CM4; o Si2141 fica atrás do I2C mestre\ndo Si2183. Clock único: cristal de 24 MHz no Si2141, repassado\npelo XOUT ao pino 44 do Si2183 (padrão do SDK Skyworks)." (at 22 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b7cdcef2-c3cc-59ee-ab28-37c1be9e39ab))
(sheet (at 118 88) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid d60b368d-9de4-53e1-944b-68c7a0e08aa1) (property "Sheetname" "Entrada ASI (GS2961A)" (at 118 87.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "06-asi.kicad_sch" (at 118 114.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "7")))))
(text "Receptor SDI/ASI Semtech GS2961A: equalizador de cabo,\nreclocker e decodificação 8b/10b. Em modo DVB-ASI o byte do TS\nsai em DOUT17..10 com PCLK de 27 MHz; DOUT18 (SYNC_OUT) marca\nas palavras de preenchimento e vira o SLWR da FX2LP #2 (ativo\nem nível baixo)." (at 120 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f796ca1e-46f9-53eb-8c7c-d8c3e3d312dc))
(sheet (at 216 88) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid 4da6f5ed-f38f-5468-91ce-7350bac27249) (property "Sheetname" "USB: chave de serviço, hub e pontes FX2LP" (at 216 87.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "07-usb.kicad_sch" (at 216 114.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "8")))))
(text "A única USB 2.0 do CM4 passa pela chave FSUSB42: em operação\nvai ao hub USB2514B; com a chave GRAVAR vai ao micro-USB\ninterno de serviço. O hub atende a FX2LP #1 (TS do\ndemodulador), a FX2LP #2 (bytes ASI) e a porta USB-A; a porta\n4 fica desligada por strap." (at 218 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e7522fe4-cbff-58d4-a49e-c5ddcb1725c5))
(sheet (at 314 88) (size 88 26) (fields_autoplaced) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (color 255 255 225 1.0000)) (uuid 2f05eafb-32a4-589e-800f-da7cd03b3ea6) (property "Sheetname" "Alarmes, painel, RTC e ventoinha" (at 314 87.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom))) (property "Sheetfile" "08-io.kicad_sch" (at 314 114.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))) (instances (project "livesafe-placa" (path "/747230d8-8e27-5458-8b0e-e1cca4ed5531" (page "9")))))
(text "4 entradas optoacopladas com comum (12-24 V, ou contato seco\nusando o +12 V auxiliar), 4 relés SPDT para a remota do\nabrigo, LEDs do painel, relógio de tempo real com bateria,\ncontrole da ventoinha e console serial." (at 316 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid d74aaac0-92cf-5a57-b2b3-ec69de740b68))
